Each membership tier unlocks additional features, higher listing limits, advanced analytics, promotional tools, and increased visibility.

This structure keeps the experience clean: every user can sell, but only members who subscribe to or qualify for a Shop Membership receive a dedicated storefront and business-oriented features. It avoids cluttering the platform with thousands of empty shop pages while giving professional sellers a branded presence.

